abstract: "A MATLAB suite that optimizes the internal mass distribution of floating wave energy converter hulls to tune heave and pitch response toward resonance with a target sea state while maintaining hydrostatic stability. It produces design mass distributions and inertial properties for theoretical, modular-precast, and thin-shell hull configurations with solid ballast."
